                "example": "Few plants grow on the arid plain because there is little rain.",
                "translation": "平原干旱少雨，生长的植物不多。",
                "application": "The climate is ___, so we choose plants that need little rain.",
                "applicationTranslation": "气候干旱，因此我们选择需雨量少的植物。",
