                "example": "A fragile ecosystem is easily damaged by sudden change.",
                "translation": "脆弱的生态系统很容易被突发变化破坏。",
                "application": "Too many visitors could harm this ___.",
                "applicationTranslation": "过多游客可能破坏这个脆弱的生态系统。",
