                "application": "Dig below the surface layer to reach the ___.",
                "applicationTranslation": "挖到表层之下，便能到达底土。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c15-r-t4-p1-0/04.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural"
