                "translation": "这些植物能够抵御强风。",
                "application": "The young trees can ___ short periods of cold.",
                "applicationTranslation": "这些幼树可以耐受短期寒冷。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c15-r-t4-p1-0/05.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural"
