                "example": "Regeneration occurs when plants grow back naturally.",
                "translation": "植物自然重新生长的过程称为自然更新。",
                "application": "New shoots appeared without planting, showing natural ___.",
                "applicationTranslation": "没有人工种植就出现了新芽，表明这里正在自然更新。",
