            "example": "Demographic data tell us about the ages and sizes of groups of people.",
            "translation": "人口统计数据告诉我们人口群体的年龄和规模。",
            "application": "The report uses ___ information to compare who lives in different districts.",
            "applicationTranslation": "报告使用人口统计信息，比较不同地区居住的人群。",
