                "english": "resource-intensive",
                "chinese": "消耗资源较多的",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Growing food in heated rooms can be resource-intensive.",
                "translation": "在加热的房间里种植食物可能会消耗大量资源。",
                "application": "The process is ___ because it needs a great deal of water and energy.",
                "applicationTranslation": "这项工艺耗费资源，因为需要大量的水和能源。",
