                "example": "Adding a larger handle is a simple adaptation to the tool.",
                "translation": "换上较大的手柄是对工具的一项简单调整。",
                "application": "This small ___ allows someone with a weak grip to use the cup.",
                "applicationTranslation": "这项小调整让握力较弱的人也能使用这个杯子。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c20-t3-p4-0/03.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural"
