                "example": "Being able to dress without help gave him greater independence.",
                "translation": "能自己穿衣、不用别人帮助，让他更能独立生活。",
                "application": "A simple jar opener can support ___ by letting people prepare food themselves.",
                "applicationTranslation": "简单的开罐器能让人自己准备食物，帮助保持独立生活的能力。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c20-t3-p4-0/07.mp3",
