            "translation": "当地家庭在自己家里接待来访者。",
            "application": "We hope to ___ a small group of guests next spring.",
            "applicationTranslation": "我们希望明年春天接待一个小型访客团。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c19-t1-p2-0/02.mp3",
            "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural"
