                "example": "Ingestion means taking something into the body by eating or swallowing it.",
                "translation": "摄入是指通过吃或吞咽把东西带进体内。",
                "application": "The study examined the ___ of tiny particles by soil animals.",
                "applicationTranslation": "研究考察土壤动物摄入微粒的情况。",
