                "chinese": "食物链",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A food chain links organisms through what eats what.",
                "translation": "食物链通过谁吃谁把生物联系起来。",
                "application": "Material eaten by a small animal may pass along the ___.",
                "applicationTranslation": "小动物吃进去的物质可能沿着食物链传递。",
