                "example": "Adaptability is the ability to change when circumstances change.",
                "translation": "适应能力是在情况变化时作出调整的能力。",
                "application": "Employers value ___ when tools and working methods keep changing.",
                "applicationTranslation": "工具和工作方法不断变化时，雇主看重适应能力。",
