            "example": "Mitigation reduces the harm or risk of a problem.",
            "translation": "降低风险措施减少问题的危害或风险。",
            "application": "The plan includes ___ measures to prevent the creation of new debris.",
            "applicationTranslation": "计划包括防止产生新碎片的降险措施。",
