            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "A tribute honours a person or an achievement.",
            "translation": "致敬事物纪念某人或成就。",
            "application": "The monument was described as a ___ rather than an ordinary storehouse.",
            "applicationTranslation": "纪念建筑被描述为致敬之物，不是普通仓库。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c16-r-t1-p2-0/01.mp3",
