                "chinese": "纺织品；织物",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A textile is material made by weaving or related processes.",
                "translation": "纺织品由编织等工艺制成。",
                "application": "The find included a ___ that needed careful handling.",
                "applicationTranslation": "发现包含需谨慎拿取的织物。",
