                "id": "w6",
                "english": "decay",
                "chinese": "腐烂；分解",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Organic material decays as biological and chemical processes break it down.",
                "translation": "生物化学过程分解有机材料造成腐烂。",
                "application": "Cold conditions could slow ___ rather than guarantee permanent preservation.",
                "applicationTranslation": "寒冷可减缓腐烂，不保证永存。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c16-r-t3-p2-0/06.mp3",
