                "chinese": "解冻；融化",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Frozen material thaws when it warms enough to stop being frozen.",
                "translation": "冻物变暖到不再冻结时解冻。",
                "application": "The object became vulnerable when the cover began to ___.",
                "applicationTranslation": "覆盖开始解冻时，物件变得易损。",
