                "example": "A fragile object can be damaged by slight force or a change in conditions.",
                "translation": "脆弱物件可能因小外力或条件改变受损。",
                "application": "The ___ find could not be handled like a modern tool.",
                "applicationTranslation": "易损遗物不能像现代工具那样拿。",
