                "english": "contracting",
                "chinese": "收缩的；范围正在缩小的",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A contracting patch becomes smaller in extent.",
                "translation": "收缩冰区的范围正变小。",
                "application": "The team examined the edge of a ___ ice patch.",
                "applicationTranslation": "团队检查正在缩小冰区的边缘。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c16-r-t3-p2-0/13.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural"
