            "chinese": "预测；对未来结果的判断",
            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "A forecast estimates what is likely to happen later.",
            "translation": "预测估计以后可能发生什么。",
            "application": "A good ___ did not automatically make users comfortable with the system.",
            "applicationTranslation": "预测好不自动让用户安心接受系统。",
