                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Losing control means having less ability to direct what happens.",
                "translation": "失去控制是更难左右发生什么。",
                "application": "The concern involved ___ over decisions.",
                "applicationTranslation": "顾虑涉及决策掌控减弱。",
