                "english": "disproportionate",
                "chinese": "不成比例的；明显过多或过少的",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Disproportionate attention gives one kind of event more weight than its share warrants.",
                "translation": "不成比例关注给某类事件超出其占比的分量。",
                "application": "The review considered ___ coverage of failures.",
                "applicationTranslation": "评论考察对失败不成比例的报道。",
