                "english": "arch",
                "chinese": "拱；拱形结构",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "An arch is a curved structure spanning an opening.",
                "translation": "拱是跨越开口的弯曲结构。",
                "application": "The diagram showed an ___ above the opening.",
                "applicationTranslation": "图示开口上方的拱。",
