                "english": "fume",
                "chinese": "烟气；有刺激性的气体",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A fume is a gas or vapour that may be unpleasant or harmful.",
                "translation": "烟气是可能难闻或有害的气体。",
                "application": "A ___ remained noticeable despite the added opening.",
                "applicationTranslation": "虽增加开口，烟气仍明显。",
