                "example": "To depict someone is to represent them in words or images.",
                "translation": "描写人物是用文字或图像呈现他。",
                "application": "The reviewer questioned how the final chapter chose to ___ the character.",
                "applicationTranslation": "评论者质疑末章怎样描写人物。",
