                "translation": "散文体用普通句子写作，不是诗体。",
                "application": "The reviewer admired the pace of the ___.",
                "applicationTranslation": "评论者赞赏行文节奏。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c17-r-t1-p3-0/18.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural"
