                "example": "Conventional wisdom is a belief widely treated as obvious or sensible.",
                "translation": "传统看法是被广泛认为显然或合理的观念。",
                "application": "The essay challenged ___ instead of merely repeating it.",
                "applicationTranslation": "文章质疑普遍看法，不只是重复。",
