                "example": "An arbitrary change is not selected by a stated reason or system.",
                "translation": "任意改变没有按明确理由或系统选出。",
                "application": "The model allowed an ___ variation before checking its effect.",
                "applicationTranslation": "模型允许先有任意变化，再检验效果。",
