                "translation": "持续压力不停且不减轻。",
                "application": "The account described ___ hunting pressure.",
                "applicationTranslation": "叙述描述持续不止的猎捕压力。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c17-r-t3-p1-0/17.mp3",
