            "example": "Subsoil lies below the upper layer of soil.",
            "translation": "底土位于表层土壤下面。",
            "application": "The drawing distinguished ___ from the hard rock beneath it.",
            "applicationTranslation": "图画区分底土与下面硬岩。",
