            "example": "A tenement houses several households, often in crowded conditions.",
            "translation": "多户住宅容纳几户人家，常较拥挤。",
            "application": "The discussion considered an existing ___ before a redevelopment proposal.",
            "applicationTranslation": "讨论在重建提案前先考虑已有多户住宅。",
