              "The later building used a {{skeletal frame}}. The engineer explained the difference between a {{load-bearing wall}} and a partition before anyone discussed removing parts. The class saw why both underground conditions and the arrangement of activities mattered. Neither a surface photograph nor a rock map alone supplied a complete explanation of the district’s growth."
