                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A prohibitively high cost is so high that it prevents an action.",
                "translation": "成本高不可攀，指高到阻止行动。",
                "application": "The increase was not necessarily ___ expensive.",
                "applicationTranslation": "增加不一定高到使人无法承担。",
