                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A fraction is a part of a larger total.",
                "translation": "一部分是较大总量中的部分。",
                "application": "The extra expense was a small ___ of the full budget.",
                "applicationTranslation": "额外费用是总预算小部分。",
