                "chinese": "高涨的热情；过度乐观",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Exuberance is strong excitement or enthusiasm, sometimes excessive.",
                "translation": "热情高涨有时会过度。",
                "application": "The author compared ___ with other explanations for investment.",
                "applicationTranslation": "作者把高涨热情与其他投资解释比较。",
