            "chinese": "碎片；残骸",
            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "Debris consists of pieces left after something breaks or is damaged.",
            "translation": "碎片是物体破裂或受损后留下的部分。",
            "application": "The team tracked ___ as well as working spacecraft.",
            "applicationTranslation": "团队追踪碎片，也追踪在用航天器。",
