            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "An orbit is the path of an object moving around another body.",
            "translation": "轨道是物体围绕另一天体运行的路径。",
            "application": "Two estimates placed the object in a different ___.",
            "applicationTranslation": "两份估算把物体放在不同轨道。",
