                "id": "w13",
                "english": "manoeuvre",
                "chinese": "调整航向或位置的动作",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A manoeuvre changes the movement or position of a vehicle.",
                "translation": "机动动作改变交通工具的运动或位置。",
                "application": "An unnecessary ___ could use resources needed for other work.",
                "applicationTranslation": "不必要的机动会消耗其他工作所需资源。",
