                "example": "A bankrupt business cannot meet its financial obligations.",
                "translation": "破产企业无法偿还到期财务债务。",
                "application": "A ___ operator might lack resources for later work.",
                "applicationTranslation": "破产运营方可能无力承担后续工作。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c18-r-t1-p3-0/23.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural"
