            "chinese": "竖起；建造",
            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "To erect a structure is to build or raise it into position.",
            "translation": "建造或竖起结构，就是把它建成或立到位。",
            "application": "The model showed how a team might ___ a heavy support.",
            "applicationTranslation": "模型展示团队可能怎样竖起重支柱。",
