            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "A structure comprised of several parts contains those parts.",
            "translation": "由几部分组成的结构包含那些部分。",
            "application": "The display was ___ separate models from different stages.",
            "applicationTranslation": "展示由不同阶段的独立模型组成。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c18-r-t2-p1-0/02.mp3",
