            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "A restriction limits what is allowed or possible.",
            "translation": "限制约束允许或可能做到的事。",
            "application": "The writer asked whether the current ___ would remain.",
            "applicationTranslation": "作者问现有限制是否会继续存在。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c18-r-t2-p2-0/02.mp3",
