            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "An ethical question concerns what is right or fair.",
            "translation": "道德问题关心什么正确或公平。",
            "application": "The review raised an ___ question as well as a technical one.",
            "applicationTranslation": "评论除技术问题外也提出道德问题。",
