            "example": "Autonomy means being able to make one’s own decisions.",
            "translation": "自主权指能够自己作决定。",
            "application": "Greater efficiency could come with less ___ for the people previously deciding.",
            "applicationTranslation": "效率提高的同时，原决策者自主权可能减少。",
