                "english": "reconstruct",
                "chinese": "根据线索重建；还原",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "To reconstruct an idea is to work it out from surviving evidence.",
                "translation": "还原想法就是根据现存证据重新整理出来。",
                "application": "Researchers tried to ___ the design from separate sketches.",
                "applicationTranslation": "研究者尝试从独立草图还原设计。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c18-r-t2-p3-0/16.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural"
