                "application": "The reviewer praised the ___ of design and practical systems.",
                "applicationTranslation": "评论者赞扬设计与实用系统的融合。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c18-r-t2-p3-0/19.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural"
