                "english": "well-ventilated",
                "chinese": "通风良好的",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A well-ventilated space allows fresh air to move through it.",
                "translation": "通风良好空间让新鲜空气流通。",
                "application": "The designer wanted ___ public spaces.",
                "applicationTranslation": "设计者希望公共空间通风良好。",
