                "chinese": "天生的",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "An innate ability is present by nature.",
                "translation": "天生能力是本来具有的。",
                "application": "The debate asked whether intelligence was entirely ___.",
                "applicationTranslation": "争论问智力是否完全天生。",
