                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "To infer a conclusion is to work it out from evidence or clues.",
                "translation": "推断就是从证据线索得出结论。",
                "application": "A learner might ___ a general message from one teacher comment.",
                "applicationTranslation": "学生可能从老师一句话推断普遍信息。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c18-r-t4-p2-0/08.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural"
