                "english": "garner",
                "chinese": "获得；引起",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "The unusual proposal garnered attention.",
                "translation": "不寻常提案引起了关注。",
                "application": "The study may ___ interest even before its results are complete.",
                "applicationTranslation": "研究在结果未完成前也可能引起兴趣。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c19-r-t1-p3-0/14.mp3",
