                "translation": "两难问题包含难以解决的相互冲突选择。",
                "application": "The editor faced a ___ between speed and further checking.",
                "applicationTranslation": "编辑在速度与进一步核查之间面临两难。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c19-r-t1-p3-0/15.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural"
