            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "Etiquette concerns accepted ways of behaving politely.",
            "translation": "礼仪涉及被接受的礼貌行为方式。",
            "application": "Correct words alone may not satisfy local ___.",
            "applicationTranslation": "只用正确词汇可能仍不符合当地礼仪。",
