                "id": "w8",
                "english": "weigh up",
                "chinese": "权衡；比较利弊",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "To weigh up options is to consider their advantages and problems.",
                "translation": "权衡选项就是比较好处与问题。",
                "application": "The panel needed to ___ several possible uses of the site.",
                "applicationTranslation": "委员会需要权衡场地的几种用途。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c19-r-t4-p2-0/08.mp3",
                "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural"
