                "english": "reserve",
                "chinese": "储量；储备",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A reserve is a supply kept or available for future use.",
                "translation": "储量或储备是以后可用的资源。",
                "application": "The estimate concerned a mineral ___, not current output.",
