                "example": "To diversify supply is to avoid depending on only one source.",
                "translation": "使供应多样化是避免只依赖单一来源。",
                "application": "The buyer wanted to ___ supply without claiming every new source was safe.",
                "applicationTranslation": "买方希望增加供应来源，但未声称新来源全都安全。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c19-r-t4-p2-0/09.mp3",
