            "chinese": "辨认；看出",
            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "It is difficult to discern a pattern in a few scattered marks.",
            "translation": "几个零散痕迹中很难看出模式。",
            "application": "Can we ___ a common method behind these different objects?",
            "applicationTranslation": "我们能从这些不同物品背后看出共同方法吗？",
