                "example": "Boat users navigate between marked channels.",
                "translation": "船只使用者沿标明水道辨路通行。",
                "application": "It became difficult to ___ through the floating growth.",
                "applicationTranslation": "穿过漂浮植物辨路通行变得困难。",
