                "chinese": "制作技艺；手艺",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Craftsmanship is skill shown in making an object well.",
                "translation": "工艺是把物品做好的技能。",
                "application": "The smooth joint revealed careful ___.",
                "applicationTranslation": "光滑接头显示细致手艺。",
