                "english": "gore",
                "chinese": "用于拼成曲面的狭长图纸片",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "A gore is a shaped strip fitted onto a curved surface.",
                "translation": "瓣形纸片是贴合曲面的成形窄条。",
                "application": "Each ___ had to align with the neighbouring piece.",
                "applicationTranslation": "每片瓣形纸片都需与相邻片对齐。",
