                "example": "A broken tool can thwart a carefully prepared attempt.",
                "translation": "工具损坏可能使认真准备的尝试受挫。",
                "application": "Missing parts threatened to ___ the plan.",
                "applicationTranslation": "零件缺失险些使计划受挫。",
