            "chinese": "可用于学习等目的的材料或设施",
            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "A resource is something useful that people can draw on.",
            "translation": "资源是人们可以利用的有用材料或设施。",
            "application": "The video collection is a useful learning ___.",
