            "example": "A cramped room has too little space for comfortable use.",
            "translation": "狭小拥挤的房间没有足够空间让人舒适使用。",
            "application": "The desk feels ___ when two people spread out their books.",
            "applicationTranslation": "两个人摊开书时，桌子显得很挤。",
