            "english": "coordination",
            "chinese": "协调配合",
            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "Coordination brings different activities together so they work well.",
            "translation": "协调让不同活动配合得顺畅。",
            "application": "Good ___ prevents two teams doing the same task twice.",
            "applicationTranslation": "良好协调避免两个团队重复做同一任务。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c9-t2-p4-0/14.mp3",
