            "application": "The supervisor welcomed ___ when a familiar problem returned.",
            "applicationTranslation": "熟悉的问题再次出现时，主管欢迎员工主动想办法。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c9-t2-p4-0/15.mp3",
