            "translation": "招募就是寻找并吸收新员工或成员。",
            "application": "The park will ___ extra staff for the busy period.",
            "applicationTranslation": "公园将在旺季招聘额外人员。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c9-t3-p2-0/10.mp3",
            "voice": "en-GB-LibbyNeural"
