            "chinese": "维修保养",
            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "Maintenance keeps equipment or buildings in working condition.",
            "translation": "维护保养让设备或建筑保持能用的状态。",
            "application": "Regular ___ helps prevent breakdowns.",
            "applicationTranslation": "定期保养有助于防止故障。",
