            "translation": "平整土地就是让地表变平。",
            "application": "They had to ___ before placing the new track.",
            "applicationTranslation": "铺设新轨道前，他们必须整平地面。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c9-t3-p2-0/15.mp3",
            "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural"
