            "id": "w11",
            "english": "allergy",
            "chinese": "过敏",
            "previousMeanings": [],
            "example": "An allergy is a harmful reaction to a particular substance.",
            "translation": "过敏是身体对某种物质产生不良反应。",
            "application": "The kitchen keeps a list of each child’s ___.",
            "applicationTranslation": "厨房留有每个孩子的过敏记录。",
