                "example": "Conditional on means dependent on a requirement being met.",
                "translation": "以某事为条件意味着须满足要求才成立。",
                "application": "The offer is ___ a satisfactory reference.",
                "applicationTranslation": "录用以推荐证明合格为条件。",
