                "translation": "灯光改变舞台氛围。",
                "application": "The technician adjusts the ___ before rehearsal.",
                "applicationTranslation": "技术员在彩排前调节灯光。",
                "audio": "audio/foundation/c11-t2-p2-0/09.mp3",
