              "A new helper met the manager in the {{foyer}}. Customers collected tickets at the {{box office}}, which had a {{separate entrance}} from the street. The helper then followed a corridor to a room {{at the far end}}.",
              "The manager explained that the public would enter the {{auditorium}} later. A rehearsal was taking place {{backstage}}, where staff were checking the {{lighting}}. The helper waited quietly until the check was finished."
