                "id": "w14",
                "english": "generalise",
                "chinese": "推广为普遍结论",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Do not generalise from one visit.",
                "translation": "不要从一次访问推断普遍情况。",
                "application": "It is risky to ___ from a tiny group.",
                "applicationTranslation": "从极小群体推广结论有风险。",
