                "chinese": "碳储存",
                "previousMeanings": [],
                "example": "Carbon storage can occur in soil.",
                "translation": "碳可以储存在土壤中。",
                "application": "The study measured ___ below the surface.",
                "applicationTranslation": "研究测量表土以下的碳储存。",
