            "translation": "young professional是从事专业工作的年轻人。",
            "application": "The new flats attract a ___.",
            "applicationTranslation": "新公寓吸引年轻职场人士。",
            "audio": "audio/foundation/c12-t4-p2-0/03.mp3",
            "voice": "en-GB-RyanNeural"
